# Intentional: no package-lock.json committed.
# This monorepo uses npm workspaces. A lockfile will be generated on first
# `npm install` in CI and on developer machines but is not checked in so that
# workspace symlink resolution works cleanly across different npm versions.
#
# CI uses `npm install --legacy-peer-deps` (see .github/workflows/ci.yml)
# to handle optional peer dependencies (react, @langchain/core, fastify, etc.)
# that workspace integration packages declare but don't always install.
